<title>GREECE: BASKETBALL: PARTISAN BEAT OLYMPIAKOS 61-60.</title>
<headline>BASKETBALL: PARTISAN BEAT OLYMPIAKOS 61-60.</headline>
<text>
<p>In Athens, Partisan (Yugoslavia) 61 Olympiakos (Greece) 60</p>
<p>(Halftime 27-24).</p>
<p>Highscorers:</p>
<p>Partisan: Predrag Drobniak 19, Miroslav Beric 10</p>
<p>Olympiakos: Panayiotis Fasoulas 12, David Rivers 11, George</p>
<p>Sigalas 9</p>
<p>Aggregate 1-1. Final in Belgrade on Thursday.</p>
</text>
